## Indefinites (open band: "Someone, nothing, everyone")

<section name="indefinites">
Memorise as whole words; the prefix pattern is not drilled. Nine core items, inline in `pronouns-section.tsx`:

| Greek   | English            |
|---------|--------------------|
| κάτι    | something          |
| τίποτα  | nothing / anything |
| όλα     | everything         |
| κάποιος | someone            |
| κανένας | no one / anyone    |
| όλοι    | everyone           |
| κάπου   | somewhere          |
| πουθενά | nowhere / anywhere |
| παντού  | everywhere         |

</section>

